# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# TypeScript Project References のビルド情報 (tsc -b が生成、追跡不要)
*.tsbuildinfo

# Yarn Berry (nodeLinker: node-modules)。install-state.gz は
# yarn install で再生成される端末ローカルなキャッシュで、毎回変化して
# 無用な diff を生むため追跡しない (corepack 運用で releases も不要)。
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/sdks
!.yarn/versions
.pnp.*

# Playwright E2E artifacts (reports, traces, screenshots, videos)
/test-results/
/e2e-report/
/playwright-report/
/.playwright/

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
